2026-07-27T12:14:02.9880946Z i /tmp/RtmpD1YWPN/duckdb
2026-07-27T12:14:02.9881386Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T12:14:02.9881899Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T12:14:02.9882346Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T12:14:02.9883030Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:14:02.9884813Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:14:02.9885604Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
